// For GitHub Codespaces. This file does two things.
//
// 1. It names what a new codespace is built from, so that ./run-demo.sh works there by itself:
//    Microsoft's official Python 3.12 image, plus three official add-ons ("features") that install Node.js 22,
//    Docker inside the codespace, and Git LFS. Each of the four is pinned by its fingerprint (the long sha256
//    text below), so every new codespace starts from exactly the same four. A newer one comes in only when its
//    fingerprint is changed here, on purpose. The fingerprints were read from Microsoft's and GitHub's
//    registries on 19 November 2026: image version 3.3.3, node 2.1.2, docker-in-docker 4.1.3, git-lfs 1.2.6.
//    A fingerprint pins the add-on, not what the add-on downloads: each installs the current release of its
//    program (Node.js 22.x, Docker, Git LFS) at the moment the codespace is built.
//    (Before, no image was named and GitHub's default image was used. Its Python 3.12 can no longer make the
//    app's private Python environment, so ./run-demo.sh failed there.)
//
// 2. Evidence Lab's Otto (phase 5c) uses the research harness in the private repository isogeny-labs/otto, at
//    the one commit pinned in backend/otto.lock.json. This asks GitHub to let a NEW codespace of this repository
//    read that repository, so ./run-demo.sh can fetch the pinned copy.
//    GitHub shows a page, "This codespace is requesting additional permissions", when the codespace is created:
//    choose "Authorize and continue".
//
// Both apply only to codespaces created after this file is on the branch. A codespace made before that keeps
// its old setup until it is rebuilt: the simplest is to make a new one (README.md, "In a Codespace").
{
  "image": "mcr.microsoft.com/devcontainers/python:3-3.12-bookworm@sha256:10717c456fb0ac3a9a78c7d9d405599b589d8faf59865f7596a4b26995b7b14c",
  "features": {
    "ghcr.io/devcontainers/features/node@sha256:20ac718cc67e7999a9d3fbb8387f1a3a5d53ecbd41fe7c075ebadb8e9b431b17": {
      "version": "22"
    },
    "ghcr.io/devcontainers/features/docker-in-docker@sha256:fae40f3c8be5a7c3b0db344c1d30341bc2c91ba38d1d5b14cd2ad72e6d65d084": {},
    "ghcr.io/devcontainers/features/git-lfs@sha256:eb47c8dbb028872131e2edc2010d423219862b2362f339fc48682d0fcb2ad728": {}
  },
  "customizations": {
    "codespaces": {
      "repositories": {
        "isogeny-labs/otto": {
          "permissions": {
            "contents": "read"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
